# Trial of Knowledge with a test bot. All five answers right: expect correct=5, passed=true.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotKno
@sleep 2
kill TtlBotKno
execute as TtlBotKno run ttl wish knowledge
execute as TtlBotKno run ttl trial
@sleep 2
ttl inspect TtlBotKno
execute as TtlBotKno run ttl answer slime
execute as TtlBotKno run ttl answer great_sage
execute as TtlBotKno run ttl answer magicules
execute as TtlBotKno run ttl answer hero
execute as TtlBotKno run ttl answer footsteps
@sleep 2
ttl inspect TtlBotKno
ttl reset TtlBotKno
ttlbot remove TtlBotKno
